```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Call prove_goal: Goal G, TargetVal]) --> CheckDepth{Depth > MaxDepth?}
    CheckDepth -- Yes --> RetDepth[Return DEPTH_LIMIT_EXCEEDED]

    CheckDepth -- No --> CheckCycle{G in ActiveGoalStack?}
    CheckCycle -- Yes --> RetCycle[Return CYCLE_DETECTED]

    CheckCycle -- No --> CheckMemory{G exists in Working Memory?}
    CheckMemory -- Yes --> MatchValue{Memory Value == TargetVal?}
    MatchValue -- Yes --> RetDirectMatch[Return SUPPORTED: Direct Fact Match]
    MatchValue -- No --> RetContradict[Return CONTRADICTED_OR_FAILED]

    CheckMemory -- No --> FindRules[Query KB for Candidate Rules concluding G == TargetVal]
    FindRules --> HasRules{Candidate Rules Found?}
    HasRules -- No --> RetUnknownBase[Return UNRESOLVED_UNKNOWN: Missing Leaf Fact]

    HasRules -- Yes --> PushStack[Push G onto ActiveGoalStack]
    PushStack --> LoopCandidates[Iterate over Candidate Rules R]

    LoopCandidates --> ProveAntecedent[Recursively Prove Antecedent Expression of R]
    ProveAntecedent --> AntStatus{Antecedent Status?}

    AntStatus -- SUPPORTED --> CacheMemory[Add G = TargetVal to Memory as INFERRED]
    CacheMemory --> PopStackSuccess[Pop G from ActiveGoalStack]
    PopStackSuccess --> RetSuccess[Return SUPPORTED: Rule Proven]

    AntStatus -- UNKNOWN --> MarkUnknownBranch[Mark Rule as Unresolved Unknown]
    MarkUnknownBranch --> NextCandidate[Next Candidate Rule]

    AntStatus -- FAILED --> MarkFailedBranch[Mark Rule as Failed/Contradicted]
    MarkFailedBranch --> NextCandidate

    NextCandidate --> MoreCandidates{More Candidate Rules to Explore?}
    MoreCandidates -- Yes --> LoopCandidates
    MoreCandidates -- No --> PopStackDone[Pop G from ActiveGoalStack]

    PopStackDone --> AnyUnknown{Any Branch UNKNOWN?}
    AnyUnknown -- Yes --> RetUnknownAll[Return UNRESOLVED_UNKNOWN: Missing Prerequisites]
    AnyUnknown -- No --> RetFailedAll[Return CONTRADICTED_OR_FAILED: All Rules Failed]
```
